      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "source",
      "text": "In interaction nets, we model λ-terms as wiring. The λ-node has a binding port (for the parameter) and a body port (for the expression). The logic depends on how variables are distributed.",
      "sourceUnitIds": [
        "u000042"
      ],
